function ensureIrrigationDashboard(){if($('irrigationSubtabs'))return;const panel=$('panel-irrigation');panel.insertAdjacentHTML('afterbegin',`<nav id="irrigationSubtabs" class="irrigation-subtabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Irrigation sections"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-irrigation-tab="status">Status</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-irrigation-tab="config">Config</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-irrigation-tab="zones">Zones</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-irrigation-tab="setup">Loxone Setup</button></nav><section id="irrigationStatusPanel" class="irrigation-subpanel" data-irrigation-panel="status"><details class="irrigation-help"><summary>How the decisions are made</summary><p>For each completed local day with adequate weather coverage, the gateway estimates reference evapotranspiration, applies the configured exposure multiplier, subtracts effective rainfall, and carries the resulting soil-water deficit forward. Forecast rainfall is discounted by the effective-rain factor and forecast weight, then subtracted from the stored deficit. If the remaining need reaches the irrigation trigger, the gateway divides it by the combined application rate of the balance group and caps the runtime. Zones in one balance group receive the same runtime; the current calculation assumes those circuits water the shared area concurrently.</p><p>Mowing uses a separate surface-wetness estimate. It adds measured rain and recorded lawn irrigation, estimates drying between sufficiently close weather samples, and permits mowing only when weather history is fresh, wetness is under its limit, no recent rain or heavy-rain lockout applies, and no lawn zone is running.</p><p>Forecast ET0, observed ET0, rainfall summaries, and data completeness are shown as diagnostics. The current irrigation runtime decision uses stored deficit and forecast rainfall; data completeness is not an additional watering gate.</p></details><section id="irrigationLiveStatus" class="irrigation-live"><div class="row irrigation-live-heading"><div><h2>Stored irrigation data and current decisions</h2><p class="notice">Read-only view of persisted weather, water balance, run history, pending sensor values, and the latest decision rationale.</p></div><button id="refreshIrrigationDashboard" class="secondary" type="button">Refresh now</button></div><div id="irrigationDashboard" class="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading irrigation state…</div></section></section><section id="irrigationConfigPanel" class="irrigation-subpanel" data-irrigation-panel="config"></section><section id="irrigationZonesPanel" class="irrigation-subpanel" data-irrigation-panel="zones"></section><section id="irrigationSetupPanel" class="irrigation-subpanel" data-irrigation-panel="setup"><div id="irrigationLoxoneGuide"></div></section>`);const config=$('irrigationConfigPanel'),zones=$('irrigationZonesPanel');let target=config;for(const el of [...panel.children]){if(el.matches('[data-irrigation-panel],#irrigationSubtabs'))continue;if(el.matches('h3')){if(el.textContent.trim()==='Irrigation zones'){target=zones;target.append(el)}else target.append(el);continue}if(el.id==='zones'||el.id==='addZone'||el.id==='irrigationMessage'){zones.append(el);continue}target.append(el)}renderIrrigationLoxoneGuide();activateIrrigationSubtab(localStorage.getItem('irrigationSubtab')||'status')}
